      "num_turns": 35,
      "result": "Implemented the Rails 8 URL shortener with PostgreSQL persistence, custom and generated codes, JSON error responses, and atomic click tracking. The executable `start.sh` runs pending migrations and starts the API on `0.0.0.0:8000`; the README explains how to use it.\n\nVerified the startup script, Rails eager loading, migration idempotence, and HTTP behavior for creation, listing, lookup, redirects and click counts, duplicate and invalid codes, invalid URLs, malformed JSON, and unknown codes. I also pinned JSON below version 3 because the newer parser caused Rails request parsing to fail.",
